  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 610 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the gentamicin sulfate shortage on 2021-07-23 and as of 2026-10-21 it has been on the list for 63 months.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An inspection of Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) ended 2019-11-21 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-02-12 — 610 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier inspections of the same plant received OAI classifications ending 2010-01-19, 2011-06-17, and 2011-08-04.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E14", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection of Cosette Pharmaceuticals NC Laboratories, LLC (FEI 1053439) ended 2023-07-21 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2023-08-25 — 728 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory shows Corvale East at 9 days on hand, Corvale General at 17 days, and Corvale Lakeside at 19 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked rule option is to transfer 41 units from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 10 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant last received a VAI classification on 2023-08-24.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
